WEBVTT

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:33.018
bringing together science,
engineering and design thinking.

00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:37.309
Imagine if another global pandemic happens

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:41.059
and the drug to combat it was developed

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:46.268
and approved not in decades or years,

00:00:46.292 --> 00:00:48.917
but in months or even in weeks.

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:52.726
Deep tech offers this potential.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:56.934
Imagine technologies like robotics,

00:00:56.958 --> 00:00:59.018
synthetic biology,

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:00.768
nanomaterial,